      "category": "Policy",
      "description": "Recommendation 1: Bundle CMS-1500 cesarean maternity professional claims to 59510 when all components are provided under the same TIN; allow 59514 only for partial care, and allow separate E&M only with modifier 25 for a separate significant E&M service on the same date of service. Apply to all states. Exempt: partial care codes, significant separately identifiable E&M, global cesarean package.\n\nRecommendation 2: For assistant participation on cesarean delivery codes 59510 and 59514, pay only when billed by an assistant surgeon with modifier 80, 81, 82, or AS on the same claim line. Apply to all states.\n\nIA \u2014 Implement a prepay frequency limit for antepartum-only partial care on CMS-1500: 59425 once for 4-6 visits and 59426 once for 7+ visits, and only for partial care. (all states)",
